        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**SOLD AT AUCTION**3 Bed  Country Bungalow on Circa 0.59Ac  in need of Modernisation (F45XR86) - Option to Purchase Additional Lands of Circa 11.31 Acres   - Public Auction on September 4th @ 3pm in Divilly's Bar,Glenamaddy\r\n\r\nThis  House  requires renovation.\r\nMay qualify for vacant home grants.\r\nOption to purchase additional Lands of Circa11.31 acres.\r\nAlso included is plot of Bog to be sold with the House.\r\nESB Water & Septic Tank with the House.\r\nA must see property which is expected to attract significant interest.\r\nImmediate enquiries from the Sole Selling agent.\r\nLegal Ms Mary Keogh ,Bruen Glynn  Solicitors ,Tuam Co Galway."
